    {
      "seq": 4,
      "text_zh": "患者没有出汗，神志清楚，自觉胸闷气短，全身困倦沉重。",
      "text_vi": "Bệnh nhân không ra mồ hôi, ý thức tỉnh táo, tự cảm thấy tức ngực khó thở, toàn thân mệt mỏi nặng nề.",
      "text_en": "The patient had no sweating, was fully conscious, felt chest tightness and shortness of breath, and was generally fatigued and heavy-limbed.",
      "text_pinyin": "huàn zhě méi yǒu chū hàn ， shén zhì qīng chǔ ， zì jué xiōng mēn qì duǎn ， quán shēn kùn juàn chén zhòng 。",
